5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to work with you all. To start, I think it would be wise to look at the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale and the weather days in the site diaries.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be here! To make sure we're making the best use of our space, I'd like to look into the booking data for specialist and general rooms and the post-occupancy review ratings!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I believe we should consider the human element of these facilities. I would like to look into the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree that we need a balanced perspective. To understand the actual impact of past projects on the users, I will look into the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure our ambitions align with financial reality, I shall examine the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a wonderful variety of perspectives already. I am curious to see if the schedules reveal any patterns in our delays. Does anyone else feel we should look into the room service records?,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"That sounds like a great idea, Shizue! I think knowing which rooms are out of service would really help us see the full picture. I'm really looking forward to seeing what we all find!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"I agree that room service records are useful, but I remain concerned about the burden on our current personnel. Let us see what the initial data reveals before we expand our scope further.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, I agree. We should first analyze the data we've already selected. It will be more efficient to see the initial results before deciding if we need additional information.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent approach, indeed. Let us avoid the temptation of data gluttony and see if our current selections provide the clarity we seek. I look forward to the revelations.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"You are all so thoughtful. I shall stick with my original choices for now, as I believe understanding our timing and the weather's impact will be very helpful for everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm with you, Shizue! I'll stick with my choices too. I really want to see how people are actually using the rooms and if they're happy with them. This is going to be so interesting!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I shall also maintain my selections. Understanding the daily routines of our technicians and the staffing levels is essential to ensure any new plan is actually sustainable for the people involved.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I will also maintain my selections. By combining the survey findings with the post-occupancy reviews, I hope to uncover whether our previous investments truly met the needs of the users.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall also remain steadfast in my choices. I suspect the gap between our projected budgets and the actual market costs may be quite illuminating. I await the results with keen interest.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see us all in agreement. I wish you all the best of luck with your research. I shall look forward to hearing what you discover in the next round.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Me too! I can't wait to hear what everyone finds. Let's all do our best to find the best plan for the campus! See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I agree. Let us proceed to the research phase. I look forward to seeing how the data reflects the reality of our staff's current workload. See you all soon.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Let us move forward and see what the data reveals. I look forward to our next discussion. See you all soon.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. Let us hope the data is as honest as we are hopeful. I shall see you all shortly, refreshed by the cold, hard facts of our financial history.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
